  "text": {
    "markdown": "## Reporting a bug in the mobile app\n\nSorry you ran into a problem. To get this to the right team quickly, I need the following. The first five are essential; the rest speed things up.\n\n**Essential**\n\n1. **What went wrong, in one sentence.** For example: \"The app crashes when I tap Pay.\"\n2. **Where in the app?** Login, Checkout, Search, Notifications, Profile, or somewhere else.\n3. **Steps to reproduce.** What you did, one step per line, from opening the app.\n4. **What you expected** and **what happened instead.**\n5. **Your device.** Phone model and OS version (for example iPhone 15, iOS 17.5 or Pixel 8, Android 14).\n\n**Helpful**\n\n6. **App version.** In the app: Profile → Settings → About.\n7. **How often it happens.** Every time, sometimes, or just once.\n8. **How bad it is.** Does it block you completely, is there a workaround, or is it cosmetic?\n9. **A screenshot or screen recording**, if you have one.\n10. **An email address** if you are happy for the team to contact you.\n\nYou can copy this template and fill it in:\n\n```\nSummary:\nArea: Login / Checkout / Search / Notifications / Profile / Other\nSteps to reproduce:\n  1.\n  2.\n  3.\nExpected:\nActual:\nDevice and OS:\nApp version:\nFrequency: always / sometimes / once\nSeverity: blocker / major / minor / cosmetic\nContact email (optional):\n```\n\n**A good report looks like this:**\n\n> **Summary:** Checkout button does nothing with a saved card.\n> **Steps:** 1. Add any item to the basket. 2. Go to Checkout. 3. Choose the saved card. 4. Tap Pay.\n> **Expected:** Payment goes through. **Actual:** The button greys out and nothing happens.\n> **Device:** Pixel 8, Android 14. **App:** 4.2.1. **Frequency:** always. **Severity:** blocker.\n\nPlease do not include passwords or full card numbers. Send me what you have and I will file it.\n",
    "validation": {
      "valid": true,
      "checks": [
        "is non-empty Markdown",
        "contains no raw HTML outside code (react-markdown would print it literally)"
      ],
      "errors": [],
      "warnings": []
    }
  },
